{"seq":3,"slug":"formal-epistemology-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：形式认识论落地到真实系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/practice/formal-epistemology-in-practice","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用与边界-形式认识论落地到真实系统\">应用与边界：形式认识论落地到真实系统</h1><p>前十一篇搭起了框架：信念度、荷兰赌、条件化、确证、AGM、知识逻辑、共同知识、悖论、分歧。这最后一篇要问两个务实的问题——这套框架真被用在哪儿？它在哪里会算不动？答案横跨贝叶斯统计、机器学习、大模型校准、法律证明与预测科学。凡涉及「信心该不该配得上准确率」，形式认识论就有话说；而每个真实场景又都在某处顶到这套工具的天花板，逼出不精确概率这样的新方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从规范框架到可测量指标\">核心概念：从规范框架到可测量指标</h2><p>形式认识论落地的枢纽是<strong>校准（calibration）</strong>：一个理想信念度主体，凡他说「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 会发生」的事，长期看应有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 真的发生。校准把抽象的「理性信念度」变成可以用数据检验的指标，而检验它的工具是<strong>恰当评分规则（proper scoring rule）</strong>——一种让「如实报告信念度」成为最优策略的评分，直接呼应<a href=\"../foundations/coherence-dutch-book\">荷兰赌一篇</a>提到的准确性优先纲领。</p>\n<p>最常用的是 Brier 分数。对一系列预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与实际结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_i\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Brier</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Brier}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(p_i-o_i)^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Brier</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分数越低越好，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为完美。它可分解为「校准项 + 精度项」，让人区分「信心系统性偏高/偏低」与「区分力不足」。对数评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac1n\\sum[o_i\\log p_i+(1-o_i)\\log(1-p_i)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span> 是另一个恰当评分规则，与信息论和贝叶斯更新联系更紧。下表对比这些落地场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>借用的框架</th>\n<th>关键指标/工具</th>\n<th>顶到的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贝叶斯统计/ML</td>\n<td>条件化 + 先验</td>\n<td>后验、贝叶斯因子</td>\n<td>先验选择、高维不收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型校准</td>\n<td>信念度 + 评分规则</td>\n<td>Brier、ECE、对数评分</td>\n<td>缩放不自动带来校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测/超预测</td>\n<td>校准 + 恰当评分</td>\n<td>Brier、校准曲线</td>\n<td>稀有事件、长期反馈慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律证明</td>\n<td>确证 + 贝叶斯定理</td>\n<td>似然比</td>\n<td>基础比率、检察官谬误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大模型的信念度-一个-2026-年的活案例\">大模型的信念度：一个 2026 年的活案例</h2><p>「AI 会不会承认自己不知道」正在把形式认识论最老的问题——信心该不该配得上真相——变成可测量的工程指标。把大语言模型输出的置信度当作信念度，用<a href=\"../bayesian/conditionalization\">条件化</a>与校准的语言去检验它，是 2025–2026 年的热点。</p>\n<p>实测数据说明问题尚未解决。KalshiBench 用预测市场的真实结果衡量模型的认识校准，Claude Opus 4.5 的 Brier 分数约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.227</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.227</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.227</span></span></span></span></span>，已接近但仍不及人类超级预测者常见的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.16030\">arXiv:2512.16030</a>）。更关键的发现是：单纯扩大规模、增强推理并不自动带来更好的校准——校准是一项需要专门训练的独立能力。研究者据此发展了用恰当评分规则（对数评分、tokenized Brier）作强化学习奖励来对齐「表达的置信」与「实际准确率」的方法，以及缓解 RLHF 引入的过度自信的校准感知 RL（可把期望校准误差 ECE 降低数个百分点）。这些工作在技术形态上，正是德菲内蒂「信念度应服从概率、应对齐真相」在神经网络里的重演——只不过「荷兰赌」换成了「评分规则损失」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;理性信念度框架&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;校准: 说70%的事约70%发生&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;恰当评分规则&lt;br/&gt;Brier / 对数评分&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;贝叶斯统计与 ML&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;大模型置信度检验&lt;br/&gt;KalshiBench, ECE&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;超预测者训练&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;法律似然比&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; H[&quot;边界: 精确单一概率不够&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;不精确概率 / 信度集&lt;br/&gt;区间而非点值&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"理性信念度框架\"] --&gt; B[\"校准: 说70%的事约70%发生\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"恰当评分规则&lt;br/&gt;Brier / 对数评分\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"贝叶斯统计与 ML\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"大模型置信度检验&lt;br/&gt;KalshiBench, ECE\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"超预测者训练\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"法律似然比\"]\n  D --&gt; H[\"边界: 精确单一概率不够\"]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[\"不精确概率 / 信度集&lt;br/&gt;区间而非点值\"]</pre><h2 id=\"法律与预测-形式化的双刃\">法律与预测：形式化的双刃</h2><p>法庭是形式认识论最有争议的应用场。用<a href=\"../bayesian/confirmation-theory\">确证一篇</a>的似然比表达 DNA 证据强度已成惯例，但概率推理也带来标志性谬误：<strong>检察官谬误</strong>把「若无辜则匹配概率极小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(E\\mid \\neg G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」误当成「匹配则无辜概率极小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\neg G\\mid E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」——正是无视基础比率的贝叶斯反演错误，与<a href=\"../bayesian/conditionalization\">条件化一篇</a>那个医学诊断例子同构。另一面，纯统计证据（如「公交车 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 属被告公司」）在信念度上足够高却被普遍认为不足以定罪，这个「裸统计证据」难题表明：法律要的「证明」不只是高信念度，还要某种因果或个别化的联系——恰是<a href=\"epistemic-paradoxes\">悖论一篇</a>里信念度与全信念裂缝的法律翻版。</p>\n<p>预测科学则是校准思想最成功的落地：Tetlock 的超预测者研究证明，通过持续追踪 Brier 分数、鼓励用概率而非模糊措辞表态、并及时用结果反馈更新，普通人的预测准确率可被系统性训练提升。这为形式认识论提供了难得的正面证据——理性信念度不只是哲学理想，而是可训练、可测量、有现实收益的技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界与批评-框架够用吗\">边界与批评：框架够用吗</h2><p>诚实地收尾，必须承认这套框架的裂缝，也正是它今天仍在演化的地方。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>精确概率的负担</strong>：要求主体对每个命题给出唯一实数，常被批为过度精确——你真能说自己对「某冷门候选人当选」的信念度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.037</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.037</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.037</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.041</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.041</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.041</span></span></span></span></span> 吗？<strong>不精确概率</strong>（用一组概率函数即「信度集」而非单一函数，信念度成为区间）是主流回应，2025 年前后在积分型不精确概率度量、不精确预测的如实激励等方向持续推进（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.16156\">arXiv:2505.16156</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.16395\">arXiv:2503.16395</a>），并与机器学习的共形预测等不确定性量化技术合流。</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑全知的阴影</strong>：<a href=\"../dynamics/epistemic-logic\">知识逻辑一篇</a>的理想主体缺陷在此重现——真实主体资源有限，无法瞬间计算所有后承，有界理性因此是绕不开的修正方向，也连着<a href=\"../../decision-theory-philosophy/practice/bounded-rationality\">决策论 hub 的有限理性</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>规范与描述的落差</strong>：人类系统性偏离贝叶斯（基础比率忽视、合取谬误），框架管「该怎么信」，却不告诉资源有限的真人「如何逼近」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些边界不是判决书，而是研究纲领的前沿。形式认识论的价值，恰在于它把「信念该如何」问得足够精确，以至于我们能清楚地看见它在哪里还不够——这是任何定性认识论都给不了的自我批评能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>校准（说 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span> 的事约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span> 发生）是框架落地的枢纽，用 Brier、对数评分等恰当评分规则检验，呼应准确性优先纲领。</li>\n<li>大模型校准是 2026 年活案例：Claude Opus 4.5 Brier ≈ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.227</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.227</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.227</span></span></span></span></span> 接近但不及人类超预测者；缩放不自动带来校准，需专门训练。</li>\n<li>法律应用双刃：似然比表达证据强度已标准化，但检察官谬误、裸统计证据难题暴露「高信念度 ≠ 法律证明」。</li>\n<li>超预测者研究证明理性信念度是可训练、可测量、有收益的技能，为框架提供正面证据。</li>\n<li>边界：精确概率负担催生不精确概率/信度集，逻辑全知催生有界理性，规范-描述落差待补——皆是当前研究前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 上游：<a href=\"../bayesian/confirmation-theory\">确证理论</a>——法律似然比与校准都建立在确证机制上。</li>\n<li>本 hub 上游：<a href=\"../bayesian/problem-of-priors\">先验问题</a>——机器学习的高维先验选择在此有理论根源。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../decision-theory-philosophy/practice/bounded-rationality\">19_decision-theory-philosophy / 有限理性</a>——逻辑全知与资源约束的决策论对应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用与边界：形式认识论落地到真实系统","id":"应用与边界-形式认识论落地到真实系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从规范框架到可测量指标","id":"核心概念-从规范框架到可测量指标"},{"level":2,"text":"大模型的信念度：一个 2026 年的活案例","id":"大模型的信念度-一个-2026-年的活案例"},{"level":2,"text":"法律与预测：形式化的双刃","id":"法律与预测-形式化的双刃"},{"level":2,"text":"边界与批评：框架够用吗","id":"边界与批评-框架够用吗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"社会认识论与意见分歧：该不该向别人让步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/practice/social-epistemology"},"next":null}